      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, sorry, what do you mean by \"goblin-friendly snack\"? I need actual feed recommendations. Can you just give me specific signs of a serious infection that would require an immediate vet call, and tell me exactly what kind of forage or grain to start with first?",
